output hideCursor CSignedInt32
effect hideCursor write console.stdout
authority hideCursor console.stdout write
memoryHeap hideCursor no
async hideCursor no
purpose hideCursor "Hide the native terminal caret while the TUI is active."
invariant hideCursor "Only ANSI cursor visibility is changed; todo storage is untouched."
label startHideCursor
storage local immutable hideCursorCode CNullTerminatedByteString "[?25l"
