run freeEditAfterLineFailureCall
ignoreValue freeEditAfterLineFailureCall Void
makeError lineBufferAllocationFailure MainError.StartupAllocationFailed allocateLineBufferError
returnError lineBufferAllocationFailure

label quitProgram
call saveTodosOnQuitCall saveTodosToJson
arg saveTodosOnQuitCall doneArray doneArray
arg saveTodosOnQuitCall titlesBuffer titlesArray
arg saveTodosOnQuitCall todoCount todoCount
arg saveTodosOnQuitCall titleCapacity titleCapacity
run saveTodosOnQuitCall
bind saveOnQuitStatus SaveTodosStatus saveTodosOnQuitCall
call saveOnQuitSucceededCall SaveTodosStatus.equal
arg saveOnQuitSucceededCall left saveOnQuitStatus
arg saveOnQuitSucceededCall right SaveSucceeded
run saveOnQuitSucceededCall
bind saveOnQuitSucceeded Bool saveOnQuitSucceededCall
branchIf saveOnQuitSucceeded useSavedExitMessage
set local exitMessage quitSaveFailedText
branch clearAndExitProgram
label useSavedExitMessage
set local exitMessage goodbyeText
branch clearAndExitProgram
label clearAndExitProgram
call clearScreenOnQuitCall clearScreen
run clearScreenOnQuitCall
ignoreValue clearScreenOnQuitCall CSignedInt32
call goodbyeCall c.puts
arg goodbyeCall text exitMessage
run goodbyeCall
ignoreValue goodbyeCall CSignedInt32
call freeDoneCall c.free
arg freeDoneCall ptr doneArray
run freeDoneCall
ignoreValue freeDoneCall Void
call freeTitlesCall c.free
arg freeTitlesCall ptr titlesArray
run freeTitlesCall
ignoreValue freeTitlesCall Void
call freeEditCall c.free
arg freeEditCall ptr editBuffer
run freeEditCall
ignoreValue freeEditCall Void
storage local immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
returnOk successfulExitCode
